{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is detected then approach, grab, move it. If held, check, do task, release. Scan otherwise. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ReleaseObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeld    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
